# Argon mechanism of the dbd1d argon case (five species)
#
# Electron impact processes: rate coefficients from BOLSIG+ with the argon
# cross sections of the SIGLO database (LXCat), for Ar and Ar*.
# Heavy-particle reactions 5 to 10: coefficients of the argon example that is
# distributed with ZDPlasKin (S. Pancheshnyi, B. Eismann, G.J.M. Hagelaar and
# L.C. Pitchford, 2008). Reactions 11 and 12 (two-body quenching of Ar* and
# two-body dissociative recombination to the ground state) were added by the
# authors. Wall losses are boundary conditions of the fluid model, not
# reactions. Units: cm3/s (two-body), cm6/s (three-body); Te and Tgas in K.

ELEMENTS
e Ar
END

SPECIES
e Ar Ar* Ar^+ Ar2^+
END

BOLSIG
Ar Ar*
END

REACTIONS
# 1-4: electron impact (BOLSIG+)
e + Ar => e + e + Ar^+         !   Bolsig+ Ar  -> Ar^+
e + Ar => Ar* + e              !   Bolsig+ Ar  -> Ar*
Ar* + e => Ar + e              !   Bolsig+ Ar* -> Ar
e + Ar* => Ar^+ + e + e        !   Bolsig+ Ar* -> Ar^+
# 5-10: recombination, ion conversion, chemo-ionization and quenching
Ar2^+ + e => Ar* + Ar          !   8.5d-7 * (Te/300.0d0)**(-0.67d0)
Ar2^+ + Ar => Ar^+ + Ar + Ar   !   6.06d-6 / Tgas * exp(-15130.0d0/Tgas)
Ar* + Ar* => Ar2^+ + e         !   6.0d-10
Ar^+ + e + e => Ar  + e        !   8.75d-27 * (Te/11600.0d0)**(-4.5d0)
Ar* + Ar + Ar  => Ar + Ar + Ar !   1.4d-32
Ar^+ + Ar + Ar  => Ar2^+ + Ar  !   2.25d-31 * (Tgas/300.0d0)**(-0.4d0)
# 11-12: added by the authors
Ar + Ar* => Ar + Ar            !   3.0d-21
e + Ar2^+ => Ar + Ar           !   3.0d-14
END
